WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.601
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.000
We hope you're all doing well
tonight,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.901
and now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:09.434
Defense officials in Ukraine
have warned that the Kremlin

00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:11.300
could be using deepfake videos

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.300
to spread misinformation
to Russians.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.133
Okay. I knew Putin didn't have
an Iron Man suit.

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:19.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:22.033
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:25.367
suggested in a court filing
yesterday that it has evidence

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:28.834
that former President Trump and
his campaign tried to illegally

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:31.300
obstruct Congress' counting of
electoral votes.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.601
Yeah, we know.

00:00:33.601 --> 00:00:35.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:37.968
Watching the House investigate
this thing is like watching

00:00:37.968 --> 00:00:40.234
"The Office"
with your grandmother.

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:43.868
"I think there's a spark
between Jim and that Pam."

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:46.801
"Yeah, Grandma, it's Season 6."

00:00:46.801 --> 00:00:48.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:50.667
A bipartisan group of
Congressional lawmakers is

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:54.534
calling on President Biden to
ban Russian oil and gas imports

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:56.968
amid the country's invasion
of Ukraine.

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:59.701
The bill has support from
both sides of the aisle

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:03.701
and the aisle.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:07.067
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
yesterday told several students

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:10.100
standing behind him at an indoor
event that they did not need to

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.534
wear face masks and said,
"Honestly, it's not doing

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:16.167
anything and we've got to stop
with this COVID theater."

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.934
Although for people who moved
from New York to Florida

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:22.133
during the pandemic, "That's the
only theater they have left."

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:25.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.868 --> 00:01:28.567
"Can you believe what they call
bagels down there?"

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:31.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.501
I'm doing the Gilded Age
New York.

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:37.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.267
"You call this a subway?"

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:41.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.501
Authorities in Germany yesterday
reportedly seized

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:47.467
a Russian billionaire's
$600 million mega yacht.

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:50.167
Said the billionaire,
"Oh, no, my backup yacht."

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:52.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:55.067
Nike announced this week that
it's temporarily closing

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:56.767
its online store in Russia.

00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:59.534
Apparently, it was giving Putin
some bad ideas.

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:04.200
[ Laughter ]
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.367
Luxury brand Bulgari said
this week that its sales

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:09.934
have increased
since the Ukrainian invasion

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:13.133
as wealthy Russians are buying
jewelry amid a collapse

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.467
of Russia's currency.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:17.801
On the plus side, it does make
oligarchs easier to spot.

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:22.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.601
A crown?

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:25.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.901 --> 00:02:29.033
IKEA has announced it will
temporarily pause manufacturing

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:31.667
and retail operations
in Russia and Belarus

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:35.000
due to the invasion of Ukraine,
while IKEA in Ukraine is opening

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.567
their doors to Russian soldiers

00:02:36.567 --> 00:02:38.367
and hoping they can't find
their way out.

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:41.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.067 --> 00:02:44.067
Amazon confirmed yesterday that
it plans to shut down

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:45.400
all of its physical bookstores.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.067
They're getting back to doing
what originally

00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:48.267
made them successful --

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.334
putting physical bookstores
out of business.

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:52.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.334 --> 00:02:56.267
A JetBlue pilot blew twice the
legal limit on a breathalyzer

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:59.033
yesterday after being removed
from the cockpit of a plane.

00:02:59.033 --> 00:03:02.534
They were immediately suspicious
since the flight was Delta.

00:03:02.534 --> 00:03:04.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:05.868
"What are you doing in here?"

00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:07.968
"Oh, let's get this puppy
in the air!"

00:03:07.968 --> 00:03:13.234
[ Laughter ]
"Where are we headed?!"

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.434
Tomorrow is National Sons Day.

00:03:15.434 --> 00:03:19.868
Said dads, "What did I get you?

00:03:19.868 --> 00:03:21.534
What did I get you?

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:24.601
How about a roof over your head,
wise guy?

00:03:24.601 --> 00:03:27.901
What did I give you?"

00:03:27.901 --> 00:03:30.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.968 --> 00:03:33.133
Really good dad.

00:03:33.133 --> 00:03:36.200
And finally, New York governor
Kathy Hochul yesterday unveiled

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.234
plans to permanently allow bars
and restaurants to offer

00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:40.968
to-go alcoholic drinks.

00:03:40.968 --> 00:03:44.100
So say hello to New York City's
newest mascot,

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.467
Martini Rat.

00:03:45.467 --> 00:03:48.501
[ Laughter and cheers ]

00:03:48.501 --> 00:03:51.267
"Well, they certainly don't have
that in Florida, do they?"

00:03:51.267 --> 00:03:52.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.467 --> 00:03:54.367
"Oh, no, Slurpee Rat.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:55.734
That's the best
they can do there."

00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:58.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.501 --> 00:04:01.133
Oh, and that was the monologue.
Alright, if you say so.

